From 4ae128439ad7fe3f394bd8827f558c24894e80c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 14:23:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 878/913] core: pta: stm32mp: remoteproc: use a bitwise and for
 the fill value
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

rproc_pta_set_memory used a logical and instead of a bitwise one when
truncating the caller supplied value, so the memory was always filled
with 0 or 1 instead of the requested byte.

Coverity issue: CID 1200395: Logical vs. bitwise operator in rproc_pta_set_memory

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 98c44598caeb2ebce8bd8c2e3951421e3ee8c2c6 core: pta: stm32mp: remoteproc: use a bitwise and for the fill value]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Opus-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I099e3f027e80520153a32217f659e582a894c258
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/596999
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/pta/stm32mp/remoteproc_pta.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/pta/stm32mp/remoteproc_pta.c b/core/pta/stm32mp/remoteproc_pta.c
index 74b5c3c1c..148075db7 100644
--- a/core/pta/stm32mp/remoteproc_pta.c
+++ b/core/pta/stm32mp/remoteproc_pta.c
@@ -283,7 +283,7 @@ static TEE_Result rproc_pta_set_memory(uint32_t pt,
 	void *dst = NULL;
 	paddr_t da = params[1].value.a;
 	size_t size = params[2].value.a;
-	uint8_t value = params[3].value.a && 0xFF;
+	uint8_t value = params[3].value.a & 0xFF;
 
 	if (pt != exp_pt)
 		return TEE_ERROR_BAD_PARAMETERS;
-- 
